Value Required version (\S+)
Value uptime (.+)
Value firmware ([^()]+)

Start
  ^VRP \(R\) software, Version ${version} \(${firmware}\)
  # CloudEngine (YunShan OS): sem a linha "VRP (R) software"; versão em
  # "Version X.Y.Z.W (plataforma Vyyyyy...)" — ex.: S6750-H.
  ^Version ${version} \(${firmware}\)
  ^.* uptime is ${uptime} -> Record
